lete chow (T6-T7-T8). Discarding T1 maintains my pair structure while removing a tile that doesn't contribute to any immediate winning pattern. This keeps my options open for \"Seven Pairs\" or other multi-pair based hands.\n\nAnswer: Play T1"}
