nd and sacrifice the valuable \"Fully Concealed Hand\" (4 points) or \"Concealed Hand\" (2 points) bonuses; (3) I already have W9(3) which can form a concealed pung; (4) The W1 pair has limited value in my current hand structure; (5) Keeping tiles concealed maintains maximum flexibility to develop a higher-scoring winning hand.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
